### Create professors
POST http://localhost:8080/api/professors
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Dr. Rao"}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/professors
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Prof. Iyer"}

### Create subjects
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Maths"}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Physics"}

### Create students
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Asha"}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Ravi"}

### Professor 1 teaches subjects 1 and 2 (one-to-many)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/professors/1/subjects/1

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/professors/1/subjects/2

### Students enroll in subjects (many-to-many)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/subjects/1

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/subjects/1

### Students get professors (many-to-many)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/professors/1

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/professors/2

### Admission record (one-to-one)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/admission-record
Content-Type: application/json

{"fees": 50000}

### View everything
GET http://localhost:8080/api/professors

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admission-records

### Unassign examples
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/subjects/1

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/professors/1/subjects/2
